    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d444">

                <pb facs="0449" n="351" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg351"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Pauncefote to
                        Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Newport, R.
                                I.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-08-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                    1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Hay</hi>: I inclose a copy of a telegram
                    received yesterday from Lord Salisbury recording the statement of the policy of
                    Her Majesty’s Government in China made in the House of Commons on the 2d.</p>
                <p>Mr. Choate has probably already informed you of the substance of it by cable, but
                    I thought you might like to receive this full text of it from a more certain
                    source than the press.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pauncefote.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d444-a1.xml" xpointer="d444-a1"/>
